cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use ARPD in your research, please cite it. Citation is encouraged,
  not required: the MIT licence places no citation condition on use.
  A framework paper is in preparation; this entry will point to it once
  it is available.
title: "ARPD: Agentic Research Paradigm Development"
abstract: >-
  A team-charter kit and Claude Code skills that let a domain researcher
  direct a team of AI coding agents to build research instruments while
  keeping authority over consequential scientific decisions.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "The ARPD authors"
version: 0.3.0-rc.1
license: MIT
keywords:
  - organizational research
  - research instruments
  - AI coding agents
  - team charter
  - research governance
